        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "WEEKS 1–8: NEURAL ADAPTATIONS (strength increases without visible size change)\n    ↓\n  Motor unit recruitment: more fibers activated per effort\n  Rate coding: faster motor unit firing rates\n  Synchronization: improved coordination of motor unit timing\n  Disinhibition: reduction of inhibitory reflexes (Golgi tendon organ)"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-STRENGTH-POWER.md#005",
      "path": [
        "03-STRENGTH-POWER.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:sports-science:03-strength-power, git-history:sports-science:03-strength-power]",
