        "current_path": "sports-science/03-STRENGTH-POWER.md",
        "id": "maxim:sports-science:strength-power",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "sports-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[strength, power]",
        "section": "sports-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Strength and Power: Neuromuscular Adaptations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "WEEKS 6+: STRUCTURAL ADAPTATIONS (hypertrophy begins)\n    ↓\n  Myofibrillar protein synthesis: more actin and myosin\n  Satellite cell activation: myonuclei added to fibers\n  Connective tissue: tendon stiffness and CSA increases (slower)\n  Bone density: stimulus-dependent increases (much slower)"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-STRENGTH-POWER.md#006",
      "path": [
