        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Strength and Power: Neuromuscular Adaptations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "PRACTICAL IMPLICATION:\n  A beginner gains strength rapidly (neural) before gaining size.\n  Maximum strength gains require both neural and structural.\n  Elite powerlifters: still largely neural (extreme motor unit recruitment).\n  Bodybuilders: primarily structural (maximum hypertrophy).\n```"
    },
