      "text": "```\nHENNEMAN'S SIZE PRINCIPLE:\n  Motor units recruited in order of size (small → large).\n  Small Type I motor units: recruited first; low force, fatigue resistant.\n  Large Type II motor units: recruited last; high force, fatigue fast."
    },
